### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### GET all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### GET book by id (success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### GET book by id (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/9999

### POST new book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Brave New World",
  "author": "Aldous Huxley",
  "isbn": "9780060850524",
  "coverUrl": null,
  "publishYear": 1932
}

### PUT book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Der Herr der Ringe (überarbeitet)",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "isbn": "9780544003415",
  "coverUrl": null,
  "publishYear": 1954
}

### DELETE book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### DELETE book (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### GET all shelves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves

### GET shelf by id (success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1

### GET shelf by id (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/9999

### POST new shelf
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Krimis",
  "description": "Spannungs- und Detektivromane"
}

### PUT shelf
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wunschliste 2026",
  "description": "Aktualisierte Wunschliste für das Jahr 2026"
}

### DELETE shelf
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3

### DELETE shelf (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3

### GET all entries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1/entries

### POST book to shelf
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "status": "READING",
  "totalPages": 1216
}

### PATCH update progress
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1/entries/1/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPage": 342,
  "totalPages": 1216
}

### PATCH update reading status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1/entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "READING"
}

### DELETE entry
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/1/entries/1

### GET notes of an entry
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entries/1/notes

### GET all public notes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes/public

### POST notes with page reference
POST http://localhost:8080/api/entries/1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageReference": 342,
  "content": "Starke Wendung auf dieser Seite",
  "isPublic": false
}

### POST note without page reference
POST http://localhost:8080/api/entries/1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageReference": null,
  "content": "Insgesamt ein großartiges Buch",
  "isPublic": true
}

### PUT update note
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageReference": 350,
  "content": "Korrigierte Notiz",
  "isPublic": true
}

### DELETE note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1

### POST validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "isbn": "123",
  "coverUrl": null,
  "publishYear": 0
}

### GET 404 with ProblemDetail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/9999

### DELETE 404 with ProblemDetail
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/9999

### Open Library search books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=tolkien

### Open Library unknown book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=xyzxyzxyznotabook123

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "secret123"
}